sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Browser (Next.js)
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant RT as Runtime
  participant W as Corpus watcher
  participant L as Research loop
  participant SY as Synthesis

  U->>API: GET /api/ask/stream?question=...
  API->>RT: research_loop()
  RT->>W: refresh_if_stale()
  W-->>RT: refresh summary or none
  RT-->>API: loop with corpus_update
  API-->>U: activity (status) new documents indexed
  L-->>U: plan
  L-->>U: reasoning (framing the question)
  loop until evidence is sufficient or budget spent
    L-->>U: activity (tool_start) search_corpus
    L-->>U: activity (tool_end) hit count and sources
    L-->>U: reasoning (finding)
    L-->>U: reasoning (judgment)
  end
  L->>SY: claims, dossier, retrieval log
  SY-->>U: answer_chunk (answer)
  SY-->>U: answer_chunk (documents, why, how, sources)
  SY-->>U: answer (citations, confidence, sections)

  par While idle
    U->>API: GET /api/corpus every 4s
    API-->>U: version, documents, chunks, recent
    U->>U: Show "Archive updated" chip when version increases
  end
